<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" style="margin:0;padding:0;">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>You've used all your prompts - here's 90% off</title>
    <style>
      @media (max-width: 640px) {
        .email-container {
          width: 100% !important;
          margin: 0 !important;
          border-radius: 0 !important;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body
    style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f5f7fb;font-family:'Segoe UI',Arial,sans-serif;color:#0f172a;"
  >
    <table
      role="presentation"
      cellpadding="0"
      cellspacing="0"
      width="100%"
      style="background:#f5f7fb;padding:32px 0;"
    >
      <tr>
        <td align="center">
          <table
            role="presentation"
            class="email-container"
            cellpadding="0"
            cellspacing="0"
            width="640"
            style="width:640px;max-width:640px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:16px;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;overflow:hidden;"
          >
            <tr>
              <td
                style="padding:28px 20px;text-align:center;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;"
              >
                <div
                  style="font-size:26px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#111827;"
                >
                  KickerGPT
                </div>
                <div
                  style="margin-top:6px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.28em;color:#6b7280;text-transform:uppercase;"
                >
                  Football intelligence
                </div>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td style="padding:28px 32px 10px;line-height:1.6;font-size:15px;">
                <p style="margin:0 0 12px;">Hey {{name}},</p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 12px;">
                  You've used all 10 of your free prompts this month.
                </p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 12px;">
                  That puts you in the top 20% of KickerGPT users. Clearly you're finding the analysis useful.
                </p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 12px;"><strong>I want to make upgrading easy for you:</strong></p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 8px;text-align:center;">
                  <span style="display:inline-block;font-size:28px;font-weight:800;color:#111827;">
                    90% off your first month of Pro
                  </span>
                </p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 12px;text-align:center;font-size:18px;">
                  Just <strong>₦1,000</strong> <span style="text-decoration:line-through;color:#6b7280;">(normally ₦10,000)</span>
                </p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 18px;text-align:center;color:#dc2626;font-weight:600;">
                  Offer is just available for the next 24hrs
                </p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 8px;"><strong>What you get:</strong></p>
                <ul style="margin:0 0 12px 18px;padding:0;color:#111827;">
                  <li style="margin:6px 0;">100 prompts per month (10x more)</li>
                  <li style="margin:6px 0;">Never hit the limit again</li>
                </ul>
                <p style="margin:0 0 20px;text-align:center;">
                  <a
                    href="{{upgradeUrl}}"
                    target="_blank"
                    rel="noopener"
                    style="display:inline-block;padding:16px 40px;background:#111827;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;border-radius:10px;letter-spacing:0.02em;font-size:16px;"
                  >
                    Upgrade Now
                  </a>
                </p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 12px;color:#4b5563;font-size:13px;text-align:center;">
                  If the button doesn't work, copy this link:
                  <br />
                  <span style="word-break:break-all;color:#1f2937;">{{upgradeUrl}}</span>
                </p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 12px;">
                  Or just reply and tell me what's holding you back. I read every response.
                </p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 8px;">Cheers,</p>
                <p style="margin:0 0 12px;">KickerGPT</p>
              </td>
            </tr>

            <tr>
              <td
                style="padding:18px 28px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;text-align:center;color:#6b7280;font-size:12px;"
              >
                If the button doesn't work, copy this link into your browser:
                <br />
                <span style="word-break:break-all;color:#4b5563;">{{upgradeUrl}}</span>
                <br /><br />
                <a
                  href="{{unsubscribeUrl}}"
                  style="color:#4b5563;text-decoration:underline;"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener"
                >
                  Unsubscribe
                </a>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </table>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </body>
</html>

